      "reason": "ReVanced's bundle, on GitLab since GitHub blocked its GitHub repository over a DMCA notice in March 2026. It has 7 Tumblr patches that name no Tumblr version: Disable dashboard ads, Disable Ad-Free Banner, Disable Tumblr TV, Disable blog notification reminder, Disable gift message popup, Disable in-app update and Fix old versions. GPL-3.0. The Tumblr code last changed on 2026-02-26, in the ReVanced Patcher v22 update. HushTumblr hasn't ported anything from it. Many GitHub repositories carry byte-for-byte copies of these files from some point in ReVanced's history, so contentHashes holds every version they've had on main and dev, and those copies count as this lineage. feat/music-announcements and feat/universal-icon-patch are pinned too: they carry a December 2024 rewrite of the Tumblr folder and nothing newer.",
